  "name": "Casting or attacking leaves Venomwing Form without interrupting the cast (#9561, #9851)",
  "contract": [
    "Live Venomancers left Venomwing Form 520307 when they began a cast or attacked, and the cast went on: a live",
    "combat log shows the form removed 11 ms before a Stone of Retreat cast began and that cast completing ten",
    "seconds later. Here the form carries the cast and attack interrupt flags. Its hover ends with it, so the",
    "caster settles a yard; for two seconds after the form ends a purely vertical fall does not count as movement,",
    "while walking still interrupts and so does a fall without the form. Expected: Venom Bolt 502870 drops the form",
    "and still lands while falling; a walking caster's Venom Bolt is cancelled; a fall without the form cancels it;",
    "Drain Life 689, cast after the client cancels the form for it, keeps channelling through a one-yard drop;",
    "without the form the same drop ends the channel; a melee swing drops the form; an idle form stays."
  ],
